= Artificial intelligence — Simple =

'''Artificial intelligence''' is the field of building computer systems that can do tasks involving things like learning, reasoning, planning, perception, language, or decision-making.

AI is not one program or one technology.

Machine learning is one important way to build AI systems, but AI also includes search, rules, planning, logic, and other methods.

An AI system can be good at a task without thinking exactly like a human.

